# Files excluded from remark lint/format.
#
# The lint rules in scripts/remark-domo-style.mjs enforce the Domo KB Style
# Guide on published KB content. Files listed here are either AI/contributor
# docs, templates, or scratch work — none of which are published as articles
# and none of which should be held to the KB rules.
#
# Note: `yarn check` already scopes itself to `--ext mdx`, so plain `.md`
# files don't run through the CLI. This file primarily quiets the VS Code
# remark language server on non-article docs.

# Root-level contributor/AI docs.
/CLAUDE.md
/README.md

# The style guide itself contains intentional examples of forbidden terms
# (e.g. "Never use 'utilize'") that would otherwise trip the lexicon rule.
/Domo-KB-Style-Guide.mdx

# Article template — placeholder content shouldn't be lint-graded.
/New-Article-Template.mdx

# Tooling/scripts directory.
scripts/

# Scratch / working files.
tmp/
